'''Bears Be Back''' (雛壇の戦士達SP, ''Hinadan no SenshitachiSP'', '''Hinamatsuri WarriorsSP''') is the March [[Cat Capsule#Lucky Capsule G|Lucky Ticket G]] event in [[The Battle Cats]] and [[Nyanko Daisensou]]. The enemy introduced in this event is [[Bears Be Back]], a [[Bears Be Bare]] variant with several different traits and [[Special Abilities|abilities]]. This event was added in [[Version 8.2 Update|Version 8.2]].

==Event==
It's sweeps week for The Battle Cats! A star-studded rainbow of Bear celebs and they're all going to get their screen time... or else!<br>
During this event, visit the {{Color|#FF0000|'''Legend Stages'''}} and select the {{Color|#FF0000|'''Bears Be Back'''}} map to take on that crowd of carnage called the {{Color|#FF0000|'''Variety Bears'''}}!<br>
{{Color|#FF00FF|'''Available March 16th (11:00am) thru April 1st (10:59am)!'''}}

Clear the stages to earn coveted "Lucky Tickets G"!<br>
Head to the normal capsule and choose the Lucky Capsules G mode to use your rewards and pick up tons of XP and valuable special items! Later stages in "Bears Be Back" will have a higher drop rate for more ticket rewards at once!<br>

※"Bears Be Back" is available once Empire of Cats Ch 3 has been cleared.<br>
※If stages for this event do not appear, please update your Battle Cats app to the most recent version and restart the app.

{{Color|#FF9900|'''● Lucky Tickets G!'''}}<br>
Use rewards from "Another New Year" to earn Catamins and XP packs from a new normal capsule option!<br>
Tap the button at the top of the Cat Capsules menu to select the {{Color|#FF00FF|'''Lucky Capsules G'''}} option and draw using your {{Color|#FF00FF|'''Lucky Tickets G!'''}}

※ The Lucky Capsules G option will appear after you own at least one Lucky Ticket G.<br>
※ Lucky Tickets G owned will be held over for the next event even after the current Lucky Capsules G event ends.<br>
※ If the Lucky Capsules G do not appear, please update your Battle Cats app to the most recent version.

